{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"bomb_keg","model_identifier":"bomb_keg","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# bomb_keg\n\nBomb keg (C1 extra model): the loose powder keg of the skeleton bomber.\n\nIron-banded wooden powder keg, 65 cm (23 u) long and about 34-37 cm across, lying on its side (axis along X) so it rolls toward -Z. Short fuse at the +X end with `fx_fuse` at its tip.\n\n- Cubes: 4 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -11.5..14.5, y 0.0..13.0, z -6.5..6.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 24 x 13 x 13 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `roll` | 1 | loop | in-place roll about the keg axis, 1 turn per second = 41 u/s (1.15 m/s) when the game moves it toward -Z; spin faster/slower to match |\n| `idle` | 2 | loop | lying still (tiny rock) |\n| `come_to_rest` | 1.6 | hold | rolls 3/4 turn while slowing, rocks back and settles flat (one-shot, holds) |\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_fuse` on `keg` at (14.5, 9, -1)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Spawn it at the bomber's keg position at the end of the bomber `drop_bomb` clip (it then lies at 1.6 s there).\n- The blast itself is a game effect at fx_fuse / the keg centre.\n"},"description":"# bomb_keg\n\nBomb keg (C1 extra model): the loose powder keg of the skeleton bomber.\n\nIron-banded wooden powder keg, 65 cm (23 u) long and about 34-37 cm across, lying on its side (axis along X) so it rolls toward -Z. Short fuse at the +X end with `fx_fuse` at its tip.\n\n- Cubes: 4 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -11.5..14.5, y 0.0..13.0, z -6.5..6.5 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 24 x 13 x 13 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `roll` | 1 | loop | in-place roll about the keg axis, 1 turn per second = 41 u/s (1.15 m/s) when the game moves it toward -Z; spin faster/slower to match |\n| `idle` | 2 | loop | lying still (tiny rock) |\n| `come_to_rest` | 1.6 | hold | rolls 3/4 turn while slowing, rocks back and settles flat (one-shot, holds) |\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_fuse` on `keg` at (14.5, 9, -1)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Spawn it at the bomber's keg position at the end of the bomber `drop_bomb` clip (it then lies at 1.6 s there).\n- The blast itself is a game effect at fx_fuse / the keg centre.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"keg_core","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-11.5,1.5,-6.0],"to":[11.5,11.5,6.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,6.5,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[40,13,63.0,23.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,25,12.0,35.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[63,13,86.0,23.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[12,25,24.0,35.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[66,0,89.0,12.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[89,0,112.0,12.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"ea174a5f-0473-562c-8d22-7c9c207cffc7"},{"name":"keg_side","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-10.0,0.5,-5.0],"to":[10.0,12.5,5.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,6.5,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,13,20.0,25.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,0,0,0],"texture":null},"south":{"uv":[20,13,40.0,25.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,0,0,0],"texture":null},"up":{"uv":[86,13,106.0,23.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[106,13,126.0,23.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"1325a375-e1df-59f7-a3a2-c682018bf12e"},{"name":"keg_bulge","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emi